/span><span begin="03:33.630" end="03:38.925">violet </span><span begin="03:38.925" end="03:39.764">in </span><span begin="03:39.764" end="03:40.107">the </span><span begin="03:40.107" end="03:41.802">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:46.160" end="03:55.432"><span begin="03:46.160" end="03:46.735">You're </span><span begin="03:46.735" end="03:47.534">the </span><span begin="03:47.534" end="03:54.017">chosen </span><span begin="03:54.017" end="03:55.432">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:00.196" end="04:08.567"><span begin="04:00.196" end="04:00.475">You're </span><span begin="04:00.475" end="04:01.377">my </span><span begin="04:01.377" end="04:06.651">violet </span><span begin="04:06.651" end="04:07.409">in </span><span begin="04:07.409" end="04:07.927">the </span><span begin="04:07.927" end="04:08.567">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:08.765" end="04:10.936"><span begin="04:08.765" end="04:08.948">Too </span><span begin="04:08.948" end="04:09.211">much </span><span begin="04:09.211" end="04:09.578">shared </span><span begin="04:09.578" end="04:10.465">between </span><span begin="04:10.465" end="04:10.936">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:11.797" end="04:14.192"><span begin="04:11.797" end="04:12.124">Saved </span><span begin="04:12.124" end="04:12.523">my </span><span begin="04:12.523" end="04:12.986">soul </span><span begin="04:12.986" end="04:13.401">like </span><span begin="04:13.401" end="04:14.192">Jesus</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:15.301" end="04:17.855"><span begin="04:15.301" end="04:15.708">Can't </span><span begin="04:15.708" end="04:16.099">quit </span><span begin="04:16.099" end="04:16.490">you </span><span begin="04:16.490" end="04:16.961">you're </span><span begin="04:16.961" end="04:17.432">like </span><span begin="04:17.432" end="04:17.855">drugs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:18.845" end="04:21.383"><span begin="04:18.845" end="04:19.196">Swear </span><span begin="04:19.196" end="04:19.571">I </span><span begin="04:19.571" end="04:19.986">tried </span><span begin="04:19.986" end="04:20.497">to </span><span begin="04:20.497" end="04:20.928">clean </span><span begin="04:20.928" end="04:21.383">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:22.341" end="04:24.917"><span begin="04:22.341" end="04:22.676">Too </span><span begin="04:22.676" end="04:23.059">much </span><span begin="04:23.059" end="04:23.546">shared </span><span begin="04:23.546" end="04:24.329">between </span><span begin="04:24.329" end="04:24.917">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:25.721" end="04:27.430"><span begin="04:25.721" end="04:26.073">Saved </span><span begin="04:26.073" end="04:26.491">my </span><span begin="04:26.491" end="04:26.922">soul </span><span begin="04:26.922" end="04:27.330">like </span><span begin="04:27.330" end="04:27.430">Jesus</span></p></div></body></tt>